<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on Alusuisse.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on Alusuisse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 2.5 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,125 CHF		 PREMIUM	9.63 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.65 CHF		  GEARING	11.95 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97-16.JAN.98   PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,111 CHF</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
